### Find a product by slug (expect 200, id 1)
# Slug tests assume a fresh `npm run seed`
GET http://localhost:3000/products/slug/black-womens-gown

### Duplicate names get -2 (expect 200, id 25)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/slug/sports-sneakers-off-white-red-2

### Unknown product slug (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/products/slug/does-not-exist

### Slug is built from the name (expect 201, slug "red-shoes-2")
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Red Shoes",
  "price": 3499,
  "stock": 5,
  "categoryId": 4
}

### Custom slug gets cleaned (expect 201, slug "my-custom-slug")
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Dress",
  "slug": "My Custom Slug!",
  "price": 5000,
  "stock": 1,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Name without letters or digits (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "!!!",
  "price": 100,
  "stock": 1,
  "categoryId": 1
}